\f1\fs22 He called upon his most competent and discreet Investigator, Detective Superintendent Hayley Lanning to head the search for the missing blank, Emil Kalheri. Lanning, a Doctor of Laws, possessed a brilliant analytical mind and unsurpassed knowledge of matters legal, easily matching any attorney. Her capacity to cut through the irrelevant and identify salient issues was matchless among her untalented peers, but her most peculiar attribute was her integrity \'96 she had some, in fact she was the most prominent example of an exception proving the rule. She was unlike any other public servant in all of the Dominion in that she had the innate ability to combine honesty and tact, skills previously unknown in the public sector. She had her fair share of enemies within (and without) the ranks of the Police, but even her most ardent critics could not help but acknowledge her superior mind and envy her integrity, all longing to know what a clear conscience felt like.
